---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalid.scss
---
# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
@use "sass:math";

@function double($x) {
	@return $x * 2;
}

:root {
	--module: math.div(8px, 2);
	--own: double(3px);
	--built-in: darken(#fff, 10%);
	--inside-calc: calc(double(3px) + 1px);
	--outer-only: darken(lighten(#000, 10%), 5%);
	--imported: bpx(3);
	--if-branch: if(style(--a: 1): darken(#fff, 10%); else: 3);
	--bare-condition: style(--a: 1);
}

@container style(--c: double(1px)) {
	a {
		color: red;
	}
}

@supports (--raw: double(1px)) {
	a {
		color: red;
	}
}

```

